From 3b2e7a32788b81310b02d8210219fa57074eefa2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Geoff Miller <contributor@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 23:15:58 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/27] perf(evidence): reuse bounded buffers during source
 validation

Share one hash buffer across each receipt validation while rehashing every current input. Preserve full SCIP decoding, native inventories, byte limits, file-growth checks and cancellation refusal.

Verified: allocation regressions failed before the change and pass after it; focused fresh, stale, malformed and cancellation fixtures pass. SCIP fixture 1419655 to 238075 B/op, Unity fixture 2552169 to 325118 B/op. Independent source review found no issues. Full canonical gate follows on this clean commit.
